As for the rest --- as a former board member, I see lots of points of view =
and understand them, and refuse to chime in on any side. I respect strongl=
y held opinions and hard work from very busy people. I am confident that t=
his will work itself out, with more or less churning based on how much good=
will and good faith is exhibited on all sides. I therefore plead for a bi=
t more of that from all sides. I know all sides feel they are exhibiting a=
lot of it now; my experience has been that when all sides feel they are gi=
ving up 90% of what they want, compromise is approaching.

